this reading. Requested follow-up: confirm what caused this 1,3-butadiene reading.","draft_es":"El 14 de febrero de 2025, el monitor estatal de Texas en HRM-7 W Baytown registró 13.61 ppb de 1,3-butadieno en la hora de las 4:00 a. m. CST, frente a una mediana de 7 días de 0.08 ppb. El viento venía de 50 grados a 6.4 mph. Hay 13 instalaciones grandes con permiso en el corredor viento arriba. Una de ellas, Cedar Bayou Hydrogen Facility, presentó el reporte 430265 por una emisión que empezó el 2024-09-30 12:00 y que, según el reporte, siguió hasta el 2025-02-28 00:00, hora local, pero el reporte no incluye 1,3-butadieno, así que no corresponde a esta lectura. Seguimiento solicitado: confirmar qué causó esta lectura de 1,3-butadieno.","drafted_by":"template (deterministic, no AI)","guard":{"passed":true,"rejected":[]}},"cannot_say":["A matching report is not proof the facility caused every reading; other sources can add to a spike.","'Not yet reported' is not a finding about any facility: Texas requires a report only at or above a reportable quantity, and air readings cannot measure how much was released (30 TAC 101.201).","The upwind corridor comes from wind direction at one monitor (geometry only), not a dispersion model; it cannot tell facilities along the same bearing apart.","Facility coordinates are as published by EPA ECHO and may be approximate.","Only regulator-grade monitors whose data the state publishes are used, never low-cost sensors."],"provenance":[{"file":"region_baytown/agc_2025_48_201_0807_43218.html","url":"https://www.tceq.texas.gov/cgi-bin/compliance/monops/agc_yearly_summary.pl","params":{"user_year":"2025","user_site":"48_201_0807","user_param":"43218","user_units":"ppb-v","report_format":"comma","user_decimals":"2"},"bytes":88362,"sha256":"2b94a3032d8fdbb8dabdab5036c9fe1bd31b2dabd586f9638d85fb222cf6ec6a","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T10:25:39+00:00"},{"file":"region_baytown/agc_2025_48_201_0617_43218.html","url":"https://www.tceq.texas.gov/cgi-bin/co